      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://morrice.mi.us/history-of-morrice-michigan/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers built a church that practiced strict abstinence from liquor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://morrice.mi.us/history-of-morrice-michigan/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before statehood, Morrice sat in a no‑man's land bordered by Chippewas, Pottawattomies, Ottawas, and Hurons.",
